// A chain of 300 method calls in one expression compiles (eider-lang#153): the checker
// recurses once per call, and the compiler's `main` runs on a stack of 512 MiB (core/RUNTIME.md
// "Stack overflow"), which holds a chain of a thousand. The depth of the expression tree is what
// matters, not the size of the program.
